#ASSERT `s 479 the court or judge shall determine the accused to be guilty of the offence and impose the punishment warranted by law` (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- returned to custody. Arguments: may appear; consents; pleads; in custody prior to appearance.
